---
export const prerender = false;
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>AnimePahe Embed Test</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 20px; background: #0a0517; color: white; font-family: sans-serif; }
    h1 { color: #c084fc; }
    .test-box { margin: 30px 0; padding: 20px; background: rgba(28, 15, 61, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; }
    .test-box h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #e879f9; }
    .test-box p { margin: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; }
    iframe { width: 100%; height: 500px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: #000; margin-top: 10px; }
    .url { font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 8px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>🧪 AnimePahe Iframe Test</h1>
  <p>Testing if AnimePahe can be embedded in an iframe from our site.</p>
  
  <div class="test-box">
    <h3>Test 1: AnimePahe Homepage</h3>
    <p>If this shows AnimePahe, iframe embedding works!</p>
    <div class="url">https://animepahe.ru/</div>
    <iframe src="https://animepahe.ru/" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms"></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="test-box">
    <h3>Test 2: AnimePahe Anime Page</h3>
    <p>Anime detail page</p>
    <div class="url">https://animepahe.ru/anime/one-piece</div>
    <iframe src="https://animepahe.ru/anime/one-piece" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms"></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="test-box">
    <h3>Test 3: GogoAnime (comparison — already working)</h3>
    <p>This one we know works</p>
    <div class="url">https://gogoanime.or.at/one-piece-episode-1/</div>
    <iframe src="https://gogoanime.or.at/one-piece-episode-1/" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms"></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="test-box" style="background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.1); border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.4);">
    <h3>⚠️ What to Check:</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Test 1: Does AnimePahe homepage show? (If yes = embed works!)</li>
      <li>Test 2: Does anime page load?</li>
      <li>Test 3: GogoAnime (already known working)</li>
    </ol>
    <p><strong>If AnimePahe blocks iframe embedding:</strong> You'll see blank/blocked box.</p>
    <p><strong>If it works:</strong> You'll see AnimePahe inside our page!</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
